cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "CapacityEquilibria.jl"
abstract: >-
  A complementarity engine for capacity-expansion equilibrium models. It builds a problem
  once, solves it with two independent solvers, PATH and CCOpt.jl, and judges each answer
  by a residual recomputed from the returned point.
type: software
